OL,3,GNEWSAStorms communication 'about
OL,4,Akeeping people safe'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunication between employers and
OL,7,Femployees during extreme weather is a
OL,8,Fkey factor to ensuring safety,
OL,9,Faccording to a human resources (HR)
OL,10,Fexpert.
OL,12,FLast week, Guernsey's government asked
OL,13,Fpeople to stay home while the worst of
OL,14,FStorm Austen passed over the Channel
OL,15,FIslands, but some people claimed they
OL,16,Fwere told to come to work despite
OL,17,Fwarnings.
OL,19,FLorna Pestana, from Law at Work, said
OL,20,Femployers had a duty of care for their
OL,21,Fworkers' health and safety.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
