OL,4,Akeeping people safe'
OL,5,
OL,6,FChannel Islands emergency planning
OL,7,Fofficer Kevin Murphy said the islands'
OL,8,Findividual States worked with
OL,9,Fbusinesses when planning responses to
OL,10,Fstorms.
